xas/live-oak-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Live Oak County has 75 years on record from 1951 to 2025. September to October is the wettest pair, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids it came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 44% of normal in September to October and 27% in October to November. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 10029 got 41% of normal that year.</p>"}
